title: "Synthesis Sovereign Intelligence Ecosystem Protocol"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-03-01
abstract: >
  The Synthesis Sovereign Intelligence Ecosystem is a constitutional AI governance
  protocol grounded in Te Ao Māori ethics, Human Enhanced Performance (HEP), and
  intergenerational flourishing. It encodes a complete operating architecture for
  sovereign intelligence: the Sacred Pou (thirteen constitutional laws), the HeMana
  Stability Scan, the SGIL digital whakapapa ledger, the Pātaka biometric intelligence
  layer, and a six-phase Runtime Loop — all governed by a single North Star:
  "In 10,000 years, a 10-year-old child flourishes in joy, safety, connection, and mauri."
